## 8. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------|-----|
| `ModuleNotFoundError: pipeline` | `src/` not in PYTHONPATH | The test runner adds it automatically; for CLI use `$env:PYTHONPATH="src"` |
| `google.auth.exceptions.DefaultCredentialsError` | Bad `GOOGLE_API_KEY` | Check key starts with `AIzaSy...` at https://aistudio.google.com |
| `llama_cloud` import error | Wrong package name | Run `pip install llama-cloud` (not `llamaparse`) |
| `sqlalchemy.exc.OperationalError` | DB tables missing or bad `DATABASE_URL` | Verify Supabase connection string in `.env` and that Phase 1 tables exist |
| `fitz` not found | PyMuPDF not installed | Run `pip install pymupdf` |
| LlamaParse returns empty string | Quota exhausted or bad API key | Check https://cloud.llamaindex.ai dashboard; pipeline falls back to PyMuPDF automatically |
| Integration test: `No income_statements row` | LLM extraction returned empty / tables missing | Check Gemini key validity; ensure DB schema is created |
